+ * before the copied async-worker barrier is released and the replacement QMP
+ * monitor starts.  The caller must have opened @transaction and prepared
+ * @runtime while the immediate child was still single-threaded.  Descriptor
+ * disposition is therefore complete before any replacement worker can run.
